{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/cbb2885d6bef31451ce75a3c289df40c.avif?t=1758720295\" width=616 height=143 /></span>The age of peace is on the brink of collapse. Diplomacy has failed. You must act before all is lost. <strong>Survive</strong> the danger, <strong>cleanse </strong>the rift, <strong>protect </strong>your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/62f4a8843032673063b829c93d683513.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aluna Rift</strong> is a challenging arcade space shooter with solo, co-op and PVP game modes. In the main game you will embark on a journey to hunt and destroy colossal bosses hidden in the depths of space. There is also an \u2018Endless Survival\u2019 mode akin to classic shoot \u2018em ups, pitting your best scores against players from around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/c5beabf329b70e5979c5aeba0f4e3249.poster.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/c5beabf329b70e5979c5aeba0f4e3249.webm?t=1758720295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/c5beabf329b70e5979c5aeba0f4e3249.mp4?t=1758720295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/02fea20679af5e9854ea4eb7a3ce1f38.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your might against a variety of gargantuan foes. Lure these behemoth beings out by causing maximum chaos in their vicinity and overcome the significant challenge they pose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/0ce679695209a6d67aa31596a06dc2e1.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/1b20e2d1f5c4eed116084599226e10a6.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow down time with this advanced evasive manoeuvre. Handy for getting out of a tight spot, assessing the battlefield, or quickly traversing towards a useful item. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/4b64bf70628e83b97831707ad81c09c8.poster.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/4b64bf70628e83b97831707ad81c09c8.webm?t=1758720295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/4b64bf70628e83b97831707ad81c09c8.mp4?t=1758720295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/25059ca846da04fefd89cdcdf05cfd5a.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey with a friend or battle them head to head. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/ef14b683dc5afa8b89364ef01da8e030.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/91a409bdcb62418732ffeeab44ac1dd1.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rift-Warp through time and space in search of your prey. Ever-changing vibrant galaxies and randomized waves of enemies means an endless exploration of deep space. No two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/86dd2efea70367d195d2659178e96714.avif?t=1758720295\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Encounter Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Survival Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up Your Ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack by Blackout Noise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Wide Screen Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with Gamepad or Keyboard &amp; Mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Rebinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1829920?t=1758720295","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1829920?t=1758720295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/6f4818123786aa65ef42a618899f8917adc65052/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758720295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/6f4818123786aa65ef42a618899f8917adc65052/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758720295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1951360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/cbb2885d6bef31451ce75a3c289df40c.avif?t=1758720295\" width=616 height=143 /></span>The age of peace is on the brink of collapse. Diplomacy has failed. You must act before all is lost. <strong>Survive</strong> the danger, <strong>cleanse </strong>the rift, <strong>protect </strong>your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap